    "detailed_description": "The humans fled for their lives! Now only aliens remain in the city. The alien queen lays eggs, and the aliens become more numerous and slowly mutate over time. Your name is Mark, a professional marksman. You have one mission, to kill the alien Queen! Your helicopter buddy will provide you with supplies during the mission.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >But This Will Not Be Easy...</h2><br><strong>INTENSE ACTION</strong><br>Shoot, slash, and blast your way through different types of mutated aliens in this dark post-apocalyptic world. Arm three different sharpshooter weapons and unlock weapon modifications and special upgrades in the arsenal.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2532180/extras/cf26e0a4ff09f1b90889950fe5dadc16.avif?t=1702866992\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2532180/extras/0b50b08ccc7653184d10b0e0a1a464f4.avif?t=1702866992\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2532180/extras/c3ee9b0d579cd52720ca695cd6e55dc7.avif?t=1702866992\" /></span><br><br><strong>UNLOCKS</strong><br>Unlock Sick Special attacks, Secrets, Skins, and Mods for your weapons! The more you unlock in-game, the more the you can control the Mission's difficulty and outcome. You are in control, go Easy or Challenge yourself to the maximum... <strong>If you think you are worthy of the Crown...</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2532180/extras/4937a8c4d2dcd73ce83558c529b7d3a5.avif?t=1702866992\" /></span><br><br><strong>MUTANTS</strong><br>From small crawling creatures to giant spinning spiky meatballs. This game has six unique mutants that will protect their mother at all costs!<b